{"data":[{"conversation_id":"2096904253533249709","created_at":"2026-09-07T10:11:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2096904253533249709"],"id":"2096904253533249709","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":1260,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":0},"text":"关于智能充电桩项目，\n\n比较接近、有原理图/PCB/BOM 可参考或复刻的项目：\n\nSmartEVSE-3：开源 EVSE 控制器，支持功率共享、OCPP，有原理图，社区较活跃。适合交流桩控制逻辑参考。\n\nCYAN_EVSE：面向国标 GB/T 18487.1 的交流桩设计（进行中），有原理图和测试板。\n\nDehneEVSE：Type 2 交流桩，KiCad"},{"conversation_id":"2095869579335786554","created_at":"2026-09-04T13:40:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2095869579335786554"],"id":"2095869579335786554","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1812,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":0},"text":"现在短剧（尤其是AI短剧）的“数据/内容”成本，主要按制作成本来看，行情波动较大，取决于质量档次。 \n\nAI短剧（当前主流）走量/低成本版：300–500元/分钟，折合约 1.8万–3万元/小时。多为自动生成、抽卡少、剧本简单。\n常规精品版：800–1500元/分钟（部分报道1500–3000元/分钟），折合约"},{"conversation_id":"2095695241261232588","created_at":"2026-09-04T02:07:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2095695241261232588"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/PatronusAI/sta…","end":51,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/PatronusAI/status/2095592844723445963","start":28,"url":"https://t.co/gT3DX5CdFi"}]},"id":"2095695241261232588","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1301,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"又一个 benchmark ， 收录一下 样本和标注。 https://t.co/gT3DX5CdFi"},{"conversation_id":"2095442135453684201","created_at":"2026-09-03T09:21:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2095442089328906527","2095442135453684201"],"id":"2095442135453684201","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1298,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"冷知识：现在很多公司收居家照片，这个是家庭隐私 ，长尾交互场景，罕见事件 ，恰恰是互联网爬虫爬不到的数据类型。"}],"meta":{"newest_id":"2096904253533249709","next_token":"7140dibdnow9c7btwoxjskylao7i6hhn8ilqjgb0s42lz","oldest_id":"2095442135453684201","result